<!--tz-meta {"id":"ruby-pricing","title":"Forgework — makerspace membership pricing","category":"Ruby","file":"ruby/pricing.html.erb","tags":["ruby","erb","pricing","membership"],"description":"Constructivist-red pricing page for fictional makerspace Forgework: tiers as bold poster rows split by diagonal red bars, no cards.","dnas":["constructivist-red"]} -->
<% bg = "#f2ede4" %>
<% ink = "#141414" %>
<% accent = "#d4201e" %>
<% muted = "#6e675c" %>
<% line = "#141414" %>
<% display = "Russo One" %>
<% body = "Oswald" %>
<% mono = "Space Mono" %>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Forgework — membership pricing · Providence makerspace</title>
<meta name="description" content="Forgework makerspace membership: three plans, every tool in the building, no initiation fee. Wood, metal, print, and electronics shops.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Russo+One&family=Oswald:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:<%= bg %>; --ink:<%= ink %>; --accent:<%= accent %>;
  --muted:<%= muted %>; --line:<%= line %>;
  --display:"<%= display %>",sans-serif;
  --body:"<%= body %>",-apple-system,sans-serif;
  --mono:"<%= mono %>",ui-monospace,monospace;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--body);
     font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden}
::selection{background:var(--accent);color:#fff}
.wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,4vw,48px)}
/* header */
.site-head{border-bottom:4px solid var(--ink)}
.site-head .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
                 padding-top:20px;padding-bottom:20px}
.brand{font-family:var(--display);font-size:22px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink)}
.brand b{color:var(--accent);font-weight:400}
nav{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase}
nav a{color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;margin-left:24px}
nav a:hover{color:var(--accent)}
/* hero: poster type, off-axis */
.hero{padding:clamp(56px,8vw,110px) 0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px);position:relative}
.hero .kicker{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.26em;text-transform:uppercase;
              color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:20px}
h1{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(46px,8vw,110px);
   line-height:1;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:24px;max-width:14ch}
h1 .red{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:0 .18em;display:inline-block;
        transform:rotate(-1.5deg)}
.hero p.lede{font-size:18px;color:var(--muted);max-width:52ch}
/* tiers: poster rows split by diagonal red bars — the distinctive choice */
.tiers{margin:clamp(32px,5vw,64px) 0 0;position:relative}
.slash{height:26px;background:var(--accent);transform:skewY(-2deg) scaleX(1.02);
       margin:0 -8px;position:relative;z-index:1}
.slash.thin{height:12px;transform:skewY(-2deg) scaleX(1.02);opacity:.85}
.tier{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:16px 40px;align-items:center;
      padding:clamp(30px,4.5vw,54px) 0;position:relative}
.tier .tname{font-family:var(--display);font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,68px);text-transform:uppercase;
            line-height:1;font-weight:400}
.tier .tname small{display:block;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.22em;
                  color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:10px;text-transform:uppercase}
.tier .price{font-family:var(--display);font-size:clamp(44px,6vw,84px);text-align:right;
            line-height:1;white-space:nowrap}
.tier .price small{font-family:var(--body);font-size:15px;font-weight:400;color:var(--muted);
                  display:block;letter-spacing:.02em}
.tier ul{list-style:none;grid-column:1/-1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
         gap:10px 28px;margin-top:6px}
.tier ul li{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);
            border-top:2px solid var(--ink);padding-top:10px}
.tier ul li b{color:var(--ink)}
.tier .go{grid-column:1/-1;margin-top:14px}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font-family:var(--body);font-weight:600;
     font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:15px 36px;
     text-decoration:none}
.btn:hover{background:var(--accent)}
.tier.featured{background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg);margin:0 calc(clamp(20px,4vw,48px) * -1);
               padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px)}
.tier.featured .tname small{color:var(--accent)}
.tier.featured .price small{color:var(--bg);opacity:.7}
.tier.featured ul li{color:var(--bg);opacity:.75;border-top-color:var(--accent)}
.tier.featured ul li b{color:#fff}
/* faq: brutal rows */
.faq{padding:clamp(56px,8vw,110px) 0}
.faq h2{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(32px,4.6vw,60px);
        text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:28px}
.faq details{border-top:3px solid var(--ink);padding:20px 0}
.faq details:last-of-type{border-bottom:3px solid var(--ink)}
.faq summary{font-weight:600;font-size:18px;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;
            display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:baseline}
.faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.faq summary::after{content:"+";font-family:var(--mono);color:var(--accent);
                   font-size:24px;font-weight:700}
.faq details[open] summary::after{content:"–"}
.faq details p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px;max-width:64ch}
/* footer */
footer{background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg)}
footer .wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr;gap:32px;
             padding-top:52px;padding-bottom:20px}
footer h4{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;
          color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:16px;font-weight:400}
footer a{display:block;color:var(--bg);text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:10px}
footer a:hover{color:var(--accent)}
footer p{font-size:15px;opacity:.7;max-width:36ch}
.fine{border-top:1px solid var(--accent)}
.fine .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;
            padding-top:18px;padding-bottom:28px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;opacity:.75}
@media (max-width:820px){
  .tier{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .tier .price{text-align:left}
  .tier ul{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  footer .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="site-head"><div class="wrap">
  <a class="brand" href="#">FORGE<b>WORK</b></a>
  <nav><a href="#plans">Plans</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a><a href="#join">Join</a></nav>
</div></header>

<main>
<div class="wrap hero">
  <p class="kicker">Makerspace · Providence RI · est. 2016</p>
  <h1>Pay for the shop.<br><span class="red">Not the sales pitch.</span></h1>
  <p class="lede">Three plans, every tool in the building, no initiation fee, no annual
  contract. Wood, metal, print, and electronics shops — plus people who will
  absolutely tell you when your weld is ugly.</p>
</div>

<div class="tiers" id="plans">
  <div class="slash thin" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="wrap"><section class="tier" aria-label="Day pass plan">
    <div><p class="tname"><small>01 — Try it</small>Day Pass</p></div>
    <div class="price">$25<small>/ day</small></div>
    <ul>
      <li><b>All four shops</b>, 9am–9pm</li>
      <li>Safety orientation included</li>
      <li>Bring your own materials</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="go"><a class="btn" href="#join">Get a day pass</a></div>
  </section></div>

  <div class="slash" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="wrap"><section class="tier featured" aria-label="Monthly membership plan">
    <div><p class="tname"><small>02 — Most members</small>Monthly</p></div>
    <div class="price">$95<small>/ month, cancel anytime</small></div>
    <ul>
      <li><b>24/7 keycard access</b></li>
      <li><b>10 machine-hours</b> incl. monthly</li>
      <li>Free intro classes (2/mo)</li>
      <li>Member storage locker</li>
      <li>Guest passes (2/mo)</li>
      <li>Slack + shop nights</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="go"><a class="btn" href="#join" style="background:var(--accent)">Become a member</a></div>
  </section></div>

  <div class="slash" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="wrap"><section class="tier" aria-label="Studio plan">
    <div><p class="tname"><small>03 — For pros</small>Studio</p></div>
    <div class="price">$340<small>/ month</small></div>
    <ul>
      <li><b>Dedicated 120 sq ft bench</b></li>
      <li><b>Unlimited</b> machine-hours</li>
      <li>Commercial use allowed</li>
      <li>Client meeting room (4h/mo)</li>
      <li>Priority class booking</li>
      <li>Loading dock access</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="go"><a class="btn" href="#join">Apply for studio</a></div>
  </section></div>

  <div class="slash thin" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</div>

<div class="wrap faq" id="faq">
  <h2>Asked constantly</h2>
  <details open><summary>I've never touched a lathe. Can I still join?</summary>
    <p>Yes — that's most members on day one. Every plan starts with a free safety
    orientation, and the monthly intro classes assume zero experience. The only
    prerequisite is closed-toe shoes.</p></details>
  <details><summary>What does "10 machine-hours" actually cover?</summary>
    <p>Time on the big shared machines: CNC mill, laser cutter, TIG welder, and the
    wide-belt sander. Hand tools and workbenches are unlimited on every plan.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Can I sell what I make?</summary>
    <p>On Studio, yes — commercial use is included. On Monthly, small-batch and
    personal sales are fine; if it becomes a business, we'll happily move you to Studio.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Is there really no contract?</summary>
    <p>Really. Month to month, cancel from your account page, keep your locker until
    the end of the billing period. We'd rather earn the renewal.</p></details>
</div>

<div class="wrap" id="join" style="padding-bottom:clamp(56px,8vw,110px)">
  <p style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);max-width:60ch">
    All plans include safety training and coffee that is, frankly, too strong.
    Tour the shop any Saturday at 11am — no appointment needed.</p>
</div>
</main>

<footer><div class="wrap">
  <div><h4>Forgework</h4>
    <p>A 14,000 sq ft makerspace in the Olneyville mill district. Member-run since 2016.</p></div>
  <div><h4>Visit</h4><a href="#">47 Millrace Lane</a><a href="#">Providence, RI 02909</a><a href="#">Saturday tours, 11am</a></div>
  <div><h4>Contact</h4><a href="mailto:hello@forgework.example">hello@forgework.example</a><a href="tel:+14015550193">(401) 555-0193</a><a href="#">House rules (PDF)</a></div>
</div>
<div class="fine"><div class="wrap">
  <span>© 2026 Forgework Cooperative · Closed-toe shoes required</span>
  <span>Set in Russo One + Oswald</span>
</div></div></footer>
</body>
</html>
